Sat Jun  4 20:10:22 EDT 2011  "Roland Haas" <roland.haas@physics.gatech.edu>
  * vistiCarpetHDF5: cache metadata for files
  
    this can give huge speedups when more than one file is open at the same
    time (VisIt call constantly creates and destroys the metadata object). It
    has the unfortunate side effect of rendering the "Close file" option
    useless. It tries to keep ReOpen functional by discarding the cached data
    if it finds that the file changed since it was added to the cache.
